{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file defines the high-level API for I2C module operations in the Realtek RTL8367/RTL8367C switch driver. It includes function prototypes for initializing I2C, reading and writing data to I2C slave devices, setting I2C byte order modes, and configuring GPIO pin groups used for I2C communication.", "external_files": ["<rtk_types.h>"], "external_methods": ["rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_data_read(rtk_uint8, rtk_uint32, rtk_uint32*)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_data_write(rtk_uint8, rtk_uint32, rtk_uint32)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_init(void)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_mode_set(rtk_I2C_16bit_mode_t)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_mode_get(rtk_I2C_16bit_mode_t*)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_set(rtk_I2C_gpio_pin_t)", "rtk_api_ret_t rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_get(rtk_I2C_gpio_pin_t*)"], "published": ["rtk_i2c_data_read", "rtk_i2c_data_write", "rtk_i2c_init", "rtk_i2c_mode_set", "rtk_i2c_mode_get", "rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_set", "rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_get"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "rtk_i2c_data_read", "description": "Reads data from a specified register of an I2C slave device using the device address and register address."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_data_write", "description": "Writes data to a specified register of an I2C slave device."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_init", "description": "Initializes the I2C interface, configuring GPIO pins, open-drain, and clock settings."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_mode_set", "description": "Sets the byte-order mode for I2C data traffic (e.g., 16-bit mode configurations)."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_mode_get", "description": "Retrieves the current byte-order mode setting for I2C traffic."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_set", "description": "Configures which GPIO pins are used for I2C SDA and SCL signals."}, {"name": "rtk_i2c_gpioPinGroup_get", "description": "Retrieves the current GPIO pin group configuration for I2C signals."}], "calls": ["rtk_i2c_data_read", "rtk_i2c_data_write", "rtk_i2c_init", "rtk_i2c_mode_set